        "Make dough: mix flour, salt, egg, sour cream",
        "Knead until smooth",
        "Rest 30 minutes",
        "Brown meat with onion, season",
        "Cool filling",
        "Roll dough thin",
        "Cut circles",
        "Fill each with meat",
        "Fold and seal edges",
        "Heat oil to 350°F",
        "Fry until golden on both sides",
        "Drain on paper towels"
